WEBVTT

00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:02.512
Easy Folk Tales. Stone Soup.

00:00:02.512 --> 00:00:05.359
A hungry traveler came to a small village.

00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:08.403
He knocked on every door and asked for a little food.

00:00:08.403 --> 00:00:11.283
But the people were poor and afraid of strangers.

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:13.450
"We have nothing," they all said.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.974
So the traveler made a fire in the middle of the village.

00:00:16.974 --> 00:00:20.665
He filled a big pot with water and put a stone into it.

00:00:20.665 --> 00:00:22.962
"What are you doing?" asked a woman.

00:00:22.962 --> 00:00:25.342
"I am making stone soup," he said.

00:00:25.342 --> 00:00:26.570
"It is very good.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:29.051
But it is even better with a little cabbage."

00:00:29.051 --> 00:00:31.831
"I think I have one cabbage," said the woman.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.140
She brought it and dropped it into the pot.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:35.384
A man came by.

00:00:35.384 --> 00:00:37.473
"Stone soup?" he said.

00:00:37.473 --> 00:00:39.067
"I have never heard of it."

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:41.489
"It is wonderful," said the traveler.

00:00:41.489 --> 00:00:44.450
"But a few potatoes make it wonderful and rich."

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:47.154
"I can find some potatoes," said the man.

00:00:47.154 --> 00:00:49.767
Soon the whole village stood around the pot.

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:51.568
One person brought carrots.

00:00:51.568 --> 00:00:53.120
Another brought onions.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.930
Others brought salt, some beans, and a piece of meat.

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.737
Everything went into the pot.

00:00:58.737 --> 00:01:00.676
At last the soup was ready.

00:01:00.676 --> 00:01:03.822
The traveler gave a bowl to every person in the village.

00:01:03.822 --> 00:01:07.395
They all agreed it was the best soup they had ever eaten.

00:01:07.395 --> 00:01:09.232
"And just think," they said.

00:01:09.232 --> 00:01:10.939
"He made it from a stone."

00:01:10.939 --> 00:01:15.725
The traveler smiled, put his stone in his pocket, and went on his way.

00:01:15.725 --> 00:01:18.759
When everyone gives a little, there is enough for all.
